- Extract count_missed_packets() as pure fn from receive() in flows_rx.rs
  for testability; call site unchanged in behaviour
- 7 tests for count_missed_packets: back-to-back, one missed, several missed,
  stream restart (>5s gap), small jitter, zero frame size, wrapping timestamps
- 2 opcode regression guards in arc_server: routing tab opcodes and
  subscription opcode — ensures DC protocol constants don't silently drift

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/arc_server.rs | 24 +++++
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/flows_rx.rs   | 98 ++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

